<title>UK: Berlin-Hannover sets 150 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin-Hannover sets 150 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and GZB Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN-HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.0	 MATURITY    13.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN.HANNOVER</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN STEPS-UP TO 7.125 PCT IF</p>
<p>NOT</p>
<p>		 CALLED AT PAR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
